[I] A generic Image viewer

[T] Xviewer is a simple image viewer which uses the gdk-pixbuf library. It can
[T] deal with large images, and zoom and scroll with constant memory usage. Its
[T] goals are simplicity and standards compliance.

[U] https://github.com/linuxmint/xviewer

[A] xviewer Developers
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/graphic
